# Supabase CLI local link state (scratch, machine-specific).
# Never track this: a committed project-ref points every clone and worktree
# at whatever project was linked when it was committed. A stale one here
# silently aimed this repo at a decommissioned database. The project identity
# belongs in supabase/config.toml (project_id), where Task 3 will record it.
supabase/.temp/
